{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 28,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely there is a mine for silver,\nAnd a place for gold which they refine.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Iron is taken out of the earth,\nAnd copper is molten out of the stone.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " setteth an end to darkness,\nAnd searcheth out, to the furthest bound,\nThe stones of obscurity and of thick darkness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He breaketh open a shaft away from where men sojourn;\nThey are forgotten of the foot;\nThey hang afar from men, they swing to and fro.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for the earth, out of it cometh bread;\nAnd underneath it is turned up as it were by fire.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The stones thereof are the place of sapphires,And it hath dust of gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That path no bird of prey knoweth,\nNeither hath the falcon’s eye seen it:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The proud beasts have not trodden it,\nNor hath the fierce lion passed thereby.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He putteth forth his hand upon the flinty rock;\nHe overturneth the mountains by the roots.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He cutteth out channels among the rocks;\nAnd his eye seeth every precious thing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He bindeth the streams that they trickle not;\nAnd the thing that is hid bringeth he forth to light.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But where shall wisdom be found?\nAnd where is the place of understanding?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Man knoweth not the price thereof;\nNeither is it found in the land of the living.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The deep saith, It is not in me;\nAnd the sea saith, It is not with me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It cannot be gotten for gold,\nNeither shall silver be weighed for the price thereof.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It cannot be valued with the gold of Ophir,\nWith the precious onyx, or the sapphire.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Gold and glass cannot equal it,\nNeither shall it be exchanged for jewels of fine gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "No mention shall be made of coral or of crystal:\nYea, the price of wisdom is above rubies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The topaz of Ethiopia shall not equal it,\nNeither shall it be valued with pure gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whence then cometh wisdom?\nAnd where is the place of understanding?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seeing it is hid from the eyes of all living,\nAnd kept close from the birds of the heavens.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Destruction and Death say,\nWe have heard a rumor thereof with our ears.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God understandeth the way thereof,\nAnd he knoweth the place thereof.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he looketh to the ends of the earth,\nAnd seeth under the whole heaven;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To make a weight for the wind:\nYea, he meteth out the waters by measure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When he made a decree for the rain,\nAnd a way for the lightning of the thunder;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then did he see it, and declare it;\nHe established it, yea, and searched it out.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.28.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.28.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And unto man he said,\nBehold, the fear of the Lord, that is wisdom;\nAnd to depart from evil is understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
